<section>
    <h2>Contract work</h2>

    <p>
        I take on a limited amount of contract
        <a href="/windows-app-development">Windows app development</a> alongside my role at
        Muse Group &mdash; WinUI 3 and Windows App SDK work, WPF to WinUI migrations, XAML
