        worldwide.
    </p>

    <p>
        If you&rsquo;re getting in touch about a project, it helps to include:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><p>What the application is and roughly who uses it.</p></li>
        <li><p>What state it&rsquo;s in today &mdash; existing codebase, a design, or a blank page.</p></li>
        <li><p>What you want to be true at the end, and any deadline you&rsquo;re working to.</p></li>
